Ultra-realistic visuals need careful optimization, especially on mobile phones.
Recommended quality profiles Feature High-end Android Mid-range Android
FPS target 60 30–60
Shadows High Medium
Texture size 2048 1024
Anti-aliasing 2x 2x or off
Render scale 1.0 0.8–0.9
Reflection probes Selected Limited
Post-processing Moderate Minimal
Additional optimization:
Use LOD Groups on cars and scenery.
Use baked lighting for static environments.
Avoid too many real-time lights.
Use GPU instancing where appropriate.
Compress textures using Android-compatible formats.
Test on the actual Android phone.
Profile CPU, GPU and memory usage.
Don't enable expensive effects such as heavy motion blur or screen-space reflections on every device.
